rtao-upstream-core

This package republishes bittensor-core from RaoFoundation/subtensor v490 with rtao's reviewed core patch (the Ed25519 erasure repair and the injectable Ledger transport) so that rtao
(https://github.com/sam0x17/rtao) can be published on crates.io, which does not accept Git
dependencies. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the authors of
bittensor-core. Report problems with this package to rtao.

